      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start, but 8 steps might still be a bit low for the legacy system. it's really aggressive about the step count for visibility. \n\ncan you expand this? i don't want it to be a mess, but it needs to be much more granular so we get a higher score. try to break everything down into as many distinct, individual steps as possible while still being technically accurate for the user. ideally, we want to push that number way higher than 8 so it actually stands out.",
